*.sqlite

# Third-party portable runtime (KiCad 10.0.6): vendor redistributable, ~1.4 GB,
# contains a 922 MB installer that exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit.
# Install KiCad from https://www.kicad.org/ instead.
70_tools/runtime_wp09_kicad/

# FreeCAD auto-backups (regenerable, ~132 MB)
*.FCBak
*.fcbak

# NOTE on Windows reserved device names (AUX/CON/PRN/NUL/COM#/LPT#):
# Paths with a reserved name in ANY component can be enumerated but not opened
# by Win32 APIs, so `git add` fails on them with exit 128. Rather than excluding
# that content, the three affected paths were renamed on 2026-09-21 (content
# byte-identical, nothing dropped) — see RENAMES_20260921.md.
